---
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<meta charset="utf-8" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
		<title>Projects — Chirag Gandhi</title>
		<style>
			:root { --ink: #1a1a1a; --muted: #666; --accent: #e8590c; --bg: #fffdf8; }
			* { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
			body { font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", sans-serif; background: var(--bg); color: var(--ink); line-height: 1.6; }
			.container { max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 2rem 1.5rem 4rem; }
			nav { display: flex; gap: 1.5rem; padding: 1.5rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; margin-bottom: 3rem; }
			nav a { color: var(--ink); text-decoration: none; font-weight: 500; }
			nav a:hover { color: var(--accent); }
			h1 { font-size: 2rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
			.sub { color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 2rem; }
			.card { border: 1px solid #e5e5e5; border-radius: 10px; padding: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; background: #fff; }
			.card h3 { margin-bottom: 0.25rem; }
			.card p { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.95rem; }
			.status { font-size: 0.8rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; margin-bottom: 0.4rem; color: var(--accent); }
		</style>
	</head>
	<body>
		<div class="container">
			<nav>
				<a href="/chirag-portfolio/">Home</a>
				<a href="/chirag-portfolio/about">About</a>
				<a href="/chirag-portfolio/projects">Projects</a>
				<a href="/chirag-portfolio/writing">Writing</a>
			</nav>
			<h1>Projects</h1>
			<div class="sub">Each project is published when it reaches a shareable state. New ones land as they ship.</div>

			<div class="card">
				<div class="status">Live</div>
				<h3>This portfolio site</h3>
				<p>Astro + GitHub Pages, built in public. The meta-project: proof I can finish things.</p>
			</div>

			<div class="card">
				<div class="status">In progress</div>
				<h3>Luxembourg Property Asymmetry Crawler</h3>
				<p>Compares broker listings against the atHome aggregator inventory to find what's listed where, and what's missing. Full pipeline: crawl → snapshot → match → dashboard.</p>
			</div>

			<div class="card">
				<div class="status">In progress</div>
				<h3>TrueReview</h3>
				<p>Honest restaurant ratings: analyzes Google reviews for suspicious patterns and shows the adjusted "true" rating.</p>
			</div>

			<div class="card">
				<div class="status">In progress</div>
				<h3>Market Evaluation — 4 Agents, 1 Day</h3>
				<p>A 4-week market study compressed into a single day using a 4-agent pipeline. Three ranked, ready-to-build business ideas.</p>
			</div>

			<div class="card">
				<div class="status">Planned</div>
				<h3>More coming</h3>
				<p>Stock experiment, Luxembourgish Anki pipeline, and more — each shipped here as it reaches a shareable state.</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</body>
</html>
